{"seq":3,"slug":"new-product-introduction-review","title":"新品引入评审（NPI）与首单量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/localized-selection/new-product-introduction-review","wordCount":1917,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"新品引入评审-npi-与首单量\">新品引入评审（NPI）与首单量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>候选清单上的商品不是自动变成在售商品的。在它占用 OTB 预算、占用库位、占用供应商产能之前，必须经过一次<strong>显式的引入决策</strong>：这款值不值得进、进多少、什么条件下退出。这个决策流程叫新品引入评审（New Product Introduction，NPI）。</p>\n<p>NPI 的价值不在于&quot;多一道审批&quot;，而在于它把三类信息强行放到同一张桌上：<strong>需求侧证据</strong>（搜索与竞品信号有多强）、<strong>供给侧约束</strong>（供应链能不能支持这个价位与这个补货节奏）、<strong>财务约束</strong>（这款占多少 OTB、能贡献多少毛利、周转能不能达标）。缺任何一类，决策都会退化成某一方的偏好。</p>\n<p>新品引入的评审结构可以直接借用阶段门（phase-gate / Stage-Gate）的成熟模式：把工作分成若干阶段，阶段之间设决策门，<strong>门不是例行汇报而是&quot;艰难的决策会议，在门上做出关键的继续/终止与优先级决策&quot;</strong>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phase-gate_process\">Phase-gate process，Wikipedia</a>）。门的判据分两类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>必过项（must-meet）</strong>：是/否的否决式清单，设计目的是&quot;直接杀死差项目&quot;——战略契合、技术可行性、合规性、风险调整后回报为正。</li>\n<li><strong>择优项（should-meet）</strong>：0–10 打分的期望特性，按加权计分排序——市场吸引力、产品优势、竞争格局、协同效应、风险回报比。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个二分对 NPI 的意义是：<strong>必过项把不合规、不可供应链支持的候选直接挡在门外，不占用评审带宽；择优项只在剩下的候选之间做排序与配额分配。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"评审门的结构\">评审门的结构</h2><h3 id=\"两道门而非一道\">两道门而非一道</h3><p>单品只设一道门会让决策变得非黑即白，而新品引入的真实风险是&quot;方向对但量错了&quot;。因此设两道：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选 SKU] --&gt; B[门1 引入门&lt;br/&gt;in/out]&#10;  B --&gt;|必过项失败| X[淘汰&lt;br/&gt;归档原因]&#10;  B --&gt;|必过项通过| C[择优项打分]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按配额排序取前 N]&#10;  D --&gt; E[首单量计算&lt;br/&gt;报童模型/周转反推]&#10;  E --&gt; F[门2 定量门&lt;br/&gt;quantity gate]&#10;  F --&gt;|超出 OTB 可用额| G[降量或延后&lt;br/&gt;进下一采购周期]&#10;  F --&gt;|额度内| H[生成采购申请]&#10;  H --&gt; I[试销期观察&lt;br/&gt;固定观察窗]&#10;  I --&gt; J{试销 KPI 达标}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[转常规补货]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[进汰换池]\">graph TD\n  A[候选 SKU] --&gt; B[门1 引入门&lt;br/&gt;in/out]\n  B --&gt;|必过项失败| X[淘汰&lt;br/&gt;归档原因]\n  B --&gt;|必过项通过| C[择优项打分]\n  C --&gt; D[按配额排序取前 N]\n  D --&gt; E[首单量计算&lt;br/&gt;报童模型/周转反推]\n  E --&gt; F[门2 定量门&lt;br/&gt;quantity gate]\n  F --&gt;|超出 OTB 可用额| G[降量或延后&lt;br/&gt;进下一采购周期]\n  F --&gt;|额度内| H[生成采购申请]\n  H --&gt; I[试销期观察&lt;br/&gt;固定观察窗]\n  I --&gt; J{试销 KPI 达标}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[转常规补货]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[进汰换池]</pre><p>门 1 解决&quot;进不进&quot;，门 2 解决&quot;进多少&quot;。把两者合成一道门会导致两种相反的失败：要么因为量算不准而否掉方向正确的款，要么因为方向对而给了一个致命的首单量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"必过项清单\">必过项清单</h3><p>必过项应当做成可机读的规则，而不是评审表上的复选框：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;npi_must_meet&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;compliance_cert&quot;, &quot;desc&quot;: &quot;目的国准入证书齐全&quot;, &quot;check&quot;: &quot;certs.superset(sku.required_certs)&quot; },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;code&quot;: &quot;supply_leadtime&quot;,&#10;      &quot;desc&quot;: &quot;供应商承诺交期不超过品类上限&quot;,&#10;      &quot;check&quot;: &quot;supplier.leadtime_days &lt;= category.max_leadtime_days&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;code&quot;: &quot;landed_margin&quot;,&#10;      &quot;desc&quot;: &quot;到岸成本后仍有正贡献毛利&quot;,&#10;      &quot;check&quot;: &quot;sku.price - sku.landed_cost - sku.fulfill_cost &gt; 0&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;code&quot;: &quot;otb_headroom&quot;,&#10;      &quot;desc&quot;: &quot;品类 OTB 剩余额度大于首单成本&quot;,&#10;      &quot;check&quot;: &quot;category.otb_available &gt;= sku.first_order_cost&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;code&quot;: &quot;role_fit&quot;,&#10;      &quot;desc&quot;: &quot;该价格带 x 属性格子属于本角色覆盖范围&quot;,&#10;      &quot;check&quot;: &quot;role_coverage.includes(sku.band_id, sku.attr_tier)&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;npi_should_meet&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;demand_evidence&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.3, &quot;scale&quot;: 10 },&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;competitive_gap&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.2, &quot;scale&quot;: 10 },&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;supply_flexibility&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.15, &quot;scale&quot;: 10 },&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;margin_potential&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.2, &quot;scale&quot;: 10 },&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;brand_fit&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.15, &quot;scale&quot;: 10 }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"npi_must_meet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"compliance_cert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"desc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"目的国准入证书齐全\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"certs.superset(sku.required_certs)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supply_leadtime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"desc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"供应商承诺交期不超过品类上限\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier.leadtime_days &#x3C;= category.max_leadtime_days\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_margin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"desc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"到岸成本后仍有正贡献毛利\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku.price - sku.landed_cost - sku.fulfill_cost > 0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"otb_headroom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"desc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"品类 OTB 剩余额度大于首单成本\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category.otb_available >= sku.first_order_cost\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"role_fit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"desc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"该价格带 x 属性格子属于本角色覆盖范围\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"role_coverage.includes(sku.band_id, sku.attr_tier)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"npi_should_meet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"demand_evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"competitive_gap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supply_flexibility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"margin_potential\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"brand_fit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>必过项里的 <code>role_fit</code> 是把 <a href=\"../category-role-structure/traffic-profit-image-defender-role\">品类角色</a> 的覆盖范围接进评审门：一个候选如果落在本角色不该覆盖的格子（例如给形象款补一个低价带大众款），应当在门上就被挡掉，而不是等到复盘时才发现结构被破坏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"首单量的三种算法\">首单量的三种算法</h2><h3 id=\"报童模型-一次性销售窗口\">报童模型：一次性销售窗口</h3><p>有明确销售窗口（季节、节日、活动）或需求不确定且首单不可快速补货时，用报童模型。设单位缺货成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单位过剩成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最优服务水平为临界比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{C_u}{C_u+C_o}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3335em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最优备货量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^* = F^{-1}\\left(\\frac{C_u}{C_u+C_o}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是需求分布函数（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newsvendor_model\">Newsvendor model，Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<p>跨境场景的两个细节决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 该取多少：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>过剩成本不只是采购成本，还包括头程运费、关税、仓储费、以及最终的清仓折价。用采购价当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会系统性高估最优备货量。</li>\n<li>缺货成本不只是毛利，还包括搜索排名损失与用户流失。跨境新品的缺货成本还包含&quot;补货要等一个海运周期&quot;的时间折损。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个可直接落地的分位数计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from statistics import NormalDist&#10;&#10;def first_order_quantity(mu, sigma, price, landed_cost, fulfill_cost,&#10;                         salvage_ratio=0.45, promo_burn=0.05):&#10;    nd = NormalDist()&#10;    # 过剩成本：整批投入减去残值回收，再加减价清货的额外折损&#10;    per_unit_invested = landed_cost + fulfill_cost&#10;    co = per_unit_invested * (1 - salvage_ratio) + price * promo_burn&#10;    # 缺货成本：损失的贡献毛利&#10;    cu = price - per_unit_invested&#10;    if cu &lt;= 0 or co &lt;= 0:&#10;        raise ValueError(&quot;contribution margin must be positive&quot;)&#10;    critical = cu / (cu + co)&#10;    z = nd.inv_cdf(critical)&#10;    q = mu + z * sigma&#10;    return {&quot;critical_ratio&quot;: round(critical, 3), &quot;z&quot;: round(z, 3),&#10;            &quot;quantity&quot;: max(1, round(q))}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statistics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NormalDist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> first_order_quantity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mu, sigma, price, landed_cost, fulfill_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                         salvage_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, promo_burn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NormalDist()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 过剩成本：整批投入减去残值回收，再加减价清货的额外折损</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    per_unit_invested </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> landed_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fulfill_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    co </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_unit_invested </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salvage_ratio) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promo_burn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 缺货成本：损失的贡献毛利</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_unit_invested</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> co </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ValueError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"contribution margin must be positive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    critical </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> co)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nd.inv_cdf(critical)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(critical, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(z, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q))}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>salvage_ratio</code> 是残值回收比例（清仓价 / 正价），<code>promo_burn</code> 是降价促销对毛利的额外侵蚀。这两个参数必须来自本品类的历史清仓数据，不能用行业平均值——不同品类的残值曲线差异极大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"周转目标反推-可重复补货的常备款\">周转目标反推：可重复补货的常备款</h3><p>若该款可以持续补货且需求相对稳定，首单不必一次压足，而是按品类周转目标反推在架所需库存。依据是周转率等于销货成本除以平均库存、平均库存取期初期末均值，以及平均售出天数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>365</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>周转率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">365 / \\text{周转率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">周转率</span></span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inventory_turnover\">Inventory turnover，Wikipedia</a>）。首单量取&quot;覆盖到第二次到货&quot;所需的量，而不是覆盖整个销售季。</p>\n<h3 id=\"试销最小量-弱证据候选\">试销最小量：弱证据候选</h3><p>证据强度为弱（仅趋势或仅竞品信号）的候选，首单不应按模型给量，而应给一个能验证需求的最小量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的确定原则是：在固定观察窗内，若真实需求达到类目健康水平，这个量会先于窗口结束卖完。低于这个量，测试结论会被&quot;卖完了但不知道是真需求还是量太小&quot;污染。</p>\n<h2 id=\"试销期的判定与退出\">试销期的判定与退出</h2><h3 id=\"固定观察窗与达标线\">固定观察窗与达标线</h3><p>新品上架后需要一个<strong>预先声明</strong>的观察窗与达标线，否则会陷入&quot;再等等看&quot;。观察窗与达标线必须在门 2 通过时就写进记录，事后修改视为无效。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观察窗</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>达标线（示例口径）</th>\n<th>未达标动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>14 天</td>\n<td>曝光量</td>\n<td>达到类目同层新品的曝光中位数</td>\n<td>补曝光位，不判死</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>28 天</td>\n<td>动销率</td>\n<td>达到品类阈值</td>\n<td>进观察或降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>56 天</td>\n<td>售罄率与贡献毛利</td>\n<td>售罄率达标且贡献毛利为正</td>\n<td>进汰换池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90 天</td>\n<td>复购与退货率</td>\n<td>退货率不高于类目均值</td>\n<td>进汰换池</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前两个窗口的作用是<strong>区分&quot;没需求&quot;与&quot;没曝光&quot;</strong>。新品在 14 天内的低动销几乎总是曝光不足造成的，此时判死是高成本错误。曝光是否充足由新品扶持位的实际曝光量与类目基线对比判定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"试销失败的归因\">试销失败的归因</h3><p>试销失败必须落一条归因码，否则同类失败会反复发生。归因码至少区分：需求不存在（搜索信号误判）、价格不对位（需求在但价位错误）、曝光不足（运营问题而非选品问题）、履约体验差（退货率或时效拖垮）、以及商品页信息缺失（缺属性、缺尺码表）。最后三条的修复都不需要重新选品，把它们归成&quot;选品失败&quot;会导致错误的下一轮决策。</p>\n<p>归因数据积累到一定量后可以反向校准门 1 的择优项权重——如果&quot;需求证据&quot;高分候选的实际失败率仍然偏高，说明该维度的打分口径有问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>NPI 是把需求证据、供应链约束、财务约束放到同一张桌上的显式决策；缺任一类会退化为单方偏好。</li>\n<li>借用阶段门结构设两道门：门 1 用必过项做 in/out（合规、交期、到岸毛利、OTB 额度、角色契合），门 2 用首单量做定量。</li>\n<li>首单量三算法：一次性窗口用报童模型临界比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{C_u}{C_u+C_o}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3335em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，常备款按周转目标反推，弱证据候选给试销最小量。</li>\n<li>报童模型的过剩成本必须包含头程、关税、仓储与清仓折价，缺货成本要计入补货周期的时间折损。</li>\n<li>试销期必须有预先声明的观察窗与达标线；前 14 天低动销优先归因为曝光不足而非需求不足。</li>\n<li>试销失败必须落归因码，区分选品问题与运营/信息问题，归因数据反向校准评审权重。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"新品引入评审（NPI）与首单量","id":"新品引入评审-npi-与首单量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"评审门的结构","id":"评审门的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"两道门而非一道","id":"两道门而非一道"},{"level":3,"text":"必过项清单","id":"必过项清单"},{"level":2,"text":"首单量的三种算法","id":"首单量的三种算法"},{"level":3,"text":"报童模型：一次性销售窗口","id":"报童模型-一次性销售窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"周转目标反推：可重复补货的常备款","id":"周转目标反推-可重复补货的常备款"},{"level":3,"text":"试销最小量：弱证据候选","id":"试销最小量-弱证据候选"},{"level":2,"text":"试销期的判定与退出","id":"试销期的判定与退出"},{"level":3,"text":"固定观察窗与达标线","id":"固定观察窗与达标线"},{"level":3,"text":"试销失败的归因","id":"试销失败的归因"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"搜索空白与竞品驱动选品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/localized-selection/search-gap-competitor-driven-selection"},"next":{"title":"Open-to-Buy 预算与品类分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/open-to-buy-budget/open-to-buy-category-budget"}}